ildren":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"EvaluateJsonValue"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"What the model should decide."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"options-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOptions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Map of option key to description, or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"null"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"object"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"criteria","children":[{"type":"text","value":"criteria"}]},{"type":"code","value":"criteria: TOptions = options.options;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"instructions-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"instructions"}]},{"type":"code","value":"instructions: EvaluateJsonValue = options.instructions;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"type","children":[{"type":"text","value":"type"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type: \"choice\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const queue = choice({\n  instructions: 'Which team should handle this ticket?',\n  options: {\n    billing: 'Payments, invoices, refunds',\n    tech: 'Bugs, outages, integrations',\n    sales: 'Pricing, upgrades, new accounts',\n  },\n})","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"toptions","text":"TOptions","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"instructions","text":"instructions","level":4},{"id":"options-2","text":"options","level":4},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"criteria","text":"criteria","level":3},{"id":"instructions-2","text":"instructions","level":3},{"id":"type","text":"type","level":3},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction choice<TOptions>(options): object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/evaluate/index.ts:365](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/evaluate/index.ts#L365)\n\nBuild a choice question. The model picks one key from `options`.\n\nOption keys become the union on `.value`. Use `null` when a key needs no\nextra description. On the wire, `options` is sent as TypeSafe `criteria`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOptions\n\n`TOptions` *extends* `Record`\\<`string`, `string` \\| `null`\\>\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n#### instructions\n\n`EvaluateJsonValue`\n\nWhat the model should decide.\n\n#### options\n\n`TOptions`\n\nMap of option key to description, or `null`.\n\n## Returns\n\n`object`\n\n### criteria\n\n```ts\ncriteria: TOptions = options.options;\n```\n\n### instructions\n\n```ts\ninstructions: EvaluateJsonValue = options.instructions;\n```\n\n### type\n\n```ts\ntype: \"choice\";\n```\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst queue = choice({\n  instructions: 'Which team should handle this ticket?',\n  options: {\n    billing: 'Payments, invoices, refunds',\n    tech: 'Bugs, outages, integrations',\n    sales: 'Pricing, upgrades, new accounts',\n  },\n})\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: choice\ntitle: choice\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction choice<TOptions>(options): object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/evaluate/index.ts:365](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/evaluate/index.ts#L365)\n\nBuild a choice question. The model picks one key from `options`.\n\nOption keys become the union on `.value`. Use `null` when a key needs no\nextra description. On the wire, `options` is sent as TypeSafe `criteria`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOptions\n\n`TOptions` *extends* `Record`\\<`string`, `string` \\| `null`\\>\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n#### instructions\n\n`EvaluateJsonValue`\n\nWhat the model should decide.\n\n#### options\n\n`TOptions`\n\nMap of option key to description, or `null`.\n\n## Returns\n\n`object`\n\n### criteria\n\n```ts\ncriteria: TOptions = options.options;\n```\n\n### instructions\n\n```ts\ninstructions: EvaluateJsonValue = options.instructions;\n```\n\n### type\n\n```ts\ntype: \"choice\";\n```\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst queue = choice({\n  instructions: 'Which team should handle this ticket?',\n  options: {\n    billing: 'Payments, invoices, refunds',\n    tech: 'Bugs, outages, integrations',\n    sales: 'Pricing, upgrades, new accounts',\n  },\n})\n```\n"}
